-- check/bad: `==` on functions. Elm crashes at runtime; beni refuses at
-- compile time (fast-compiler.md §3.1 point 5). `dischargeMethod` raises
-- it itself now (static-dispatch-spike.md §6.3, §3.4) and points at the
-- OPERATOR, which is what §10.3 asks of a well-known call.
pub same : (Int → Int), (Int → Int) → Bool
same f g = f == g
